#: ../../compatibility.rst:38
msgid "An unchanged page reports its diagnostics again. Therefore ``-W`` has the same meaning on a clean build and an unchanged build. A deleted document's page is removed. Publication uses a recoverable journal. The next build settles an interrupted commit. See :doc:`internals/publication` for the invariant and its platform boundary."
msgstr ""

